            "review_title": "Review at Ky Uc Cafe & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Paul\nShanghai, China48 contributions\n0\nA very unusual cafe restaurant will surprise you!\nSep 2019 • Friends\nWonderful spacious cafeteria with good coffee to drink and many things to see. Comfortable seatings inside and outside, a lot of antiques to explore, and many classic motor bikes, too!!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 7, 2019",
